usage: testinfra.py [-h] --scope SCOPE [SCOPE ...]
                    [--baseline-failures BASELINE_FAILURES]
                    [--seeds-file SEEDS_FILE] [--site-packages SITE_PACKAGES]
                    [--out OUT] [--stem STEM]
                    repo_root

Static test-infrastructure detection for a Python repository and a scope
(deconvolution-loop task 2.2).

positional arguments:
  repo_root

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --scope SCOPE [SCOPE ...]
                        scope source files (relative to the root)
  --baseline-failures BASELINE_FAILURES
                        recorded failures: list, {cause: [ids]} or
                        {'deselect': [ids]}
  --seeds-file SEEDS_FILE
                        a recorded seed list (one file per line) to apply
                        deselections to as well
  --site-packages SITE_PACKAGES
                        follow store-related third-party modules here (static
                        read)
  --out OUT
  --stem STEM           output file stem (default testinfra: .json and .md)
